# The `p`-power cyclotomic tower inside `ℚ̄_p`: definition and its fixing subgroups

Task cloud-b3/w11 (author D, 2026-11-16): the arithmetic edge of H-120
(`ZInQ.Contrib.HodgeSplit.TateTwistInvariants`, Tate 1967 §3.3 Thm 2). Self contained: it
imports `ZInQKernel.Contrib.G9.I4Layer` only for `PadicAlgCl`/`ℚ_[p]` and nothing of
`ZInQKernel.OneProof`.

`PadicAlgCl.cyclotomicTower p n = ℚ_p(μ_{p^n}) ⊆ ℚ̄_p = PadicAlgCl p`, together with the
reading of `Gal(ℚ̄_p/ℚ_p(μ_{p^n}))` as `{σ | σ ζ = ζ}` for one primitive `p^n`-th root `ζ`, and
its congruence form `σ ζ = ζ^b ↦ p^n ∣ b − 1`. The degrees of the tower and the degree-`p` step
are in `ZInQKernel.Contrib.CloudB3W11Cyclotomic.TowerDegree`.

## Provenance

The definition and the statements and structure of the proofs are ported from
[anthropics/fermats-last-theorem](https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem), commit
`6e837e75355538c7f80bab5b956861e86c4eacc2`, files
`Definitions/Def_PadicAlgCl_CyclotomicTower.lean` and
`P2M/Sol/S_PadicAlgCl_finrank_cyclotomicTower_and_pow_mem_fixingSubgroup.lean`
(Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC; Apache License, Version 2.0 — the licence text as already
