`NOTICE.upstream` and `ATTRIBUTION.upstream.md`). The upstream names
`PadicAlgCl.cyclotomicTower` and `PadicAlgCl.mem_cyclotomicTower_of_pow_eq_one` are kept.
Changes made here: the upstream `local notation` for `ℚ̄_p` and for its automorphism group is
removed and the types are written out, the upstream `p2m_export` build-time commands and the
`P2M.Util` import are dropped (this repository admits no code that runs at build time), the
upstream `IsSepClosedOfCharZero` route to a primitive root is replaced by Mathlib's
